# belt/sheaths/sword: A3's scabbard on the left hip with its baldric across the chest; empty and steeper when the sword is drawn
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role sheath sword
layer belt
anchor hip
keys sheath

