# the run's lag (FOLK-BODY, P2b production; L's was the slice's): the scabbard a beat behind the bob, its foot swung out
# a pixel (D, U) or the whole scabbard a pixel back (R), so every run frame that names `sheath=lag` has a view
view D key lag origin 4 7
|ih..............
